Third-party software

agent-desktop (https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop)
Vercel Labs. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The accessibility desktop tools (computer_use.accessibility, TD-5220) run
the unmodified agent-desktop command-line tool, release 1.0.2, as a separate
process. This repository does not include its source or binaries. The Linux
packages (AppImage, deb) ship the unmodified release binaries agent-desktop
and agent-desktop-linux-clipboard-owner, and the macOS app ships
agent-desktop and agent-desktop-macos-helper, re-signed with the app's own
code signature. All are downloaded at build time and checked against pinned
SHA-256 digests (TD-5221, TD-5228), and ship together with this notice and a
copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 (licenses/LICENSE and
licenses/NOTICE in the installed app's resources).
